		(descr "Hroparts K6-6272S LED tact switch, vertical SMD, 10 mm cap, 13 mm high (LCSC C693826 = K6-6272S03, blue; S01 white, S02 red, S04 green, S05 yellow, S06 orange). Pads 1+2 and 3+4 are the two switch contacts, 5 = LED anode, 6 = LED cathode (the opposite of the K6-6140A). 2 columns 8.5 mm apart, rows 2.54 mm, pads 2.5 x 1.0, one dia 1.0 locating hole at the centre of the top row (pads 3, 4).")
