		(descr "Top-Up EC12PL illuminated 12 mm rotary encoder with RGB LED and push switch (SparkFun COM-15141), from the maker drawing MD-15141. Pads: A, C, B (encoder, 5 mm span, 7.5 mm below the axis); 1 R cathode, 2 G cathode, 3 switch, 4 B cathode, 5 common anode (7.0 mm above the axis, 2 mm pitch); S = the two frame lugs (rectangular holes 2.0 x 2.1 at +-5.6). Origin = shaft axis. Shaft tip 25.3 mm above the board, M9 x 0.75 bushing from 7.8 mm.")
